OL,3,GNEWSAApology as water supply disrupted
OL,4,Ain several towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apology has been issued as residents
OL,7,Fin several towns continue to experience
OL,8,Fdisruption to their water supply.
OL,10,FSouth West Water said engineers were
OL,11,Fworking to fix an issue caused by air
OL,12,Fpockets in the network serving
OL,13,FBuckfastleigh, Paignton, Kingsbridge
OL,14,Fand Totnes in Devon.
OL,16,FA number of people said they had
OL,17,Fexperienced problems since Thursday,
OL,18,Fwhich were resolved by Friday but then
OL,19,Freturned on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
